# View-edge rule 2 (ViewEdgePush, $81:E9CD) with Aladdin at the view's
# edge and on firm ground ($81:E9F8), which no script reaches: no level
# runs rule 2. On the first level (Aladdin at x $003A; the floor there a
# flat tile, behaviour 3, its surface at y $01C8), unit calls by JSR on his
# record (M and X 8-bit, DB $80), his y ($08EA) set to $01CC so that probe
# 4's point (5 to the side, 2 up) is in that floor; the view's left edge
# ($1773) set 8 pixels left of him (inside the 16, not at him: not hurt),
# then at his x (hurt: state $8C, the rule up by one); the machine put back
# after each.
load build/aladdin/states/level1.state
wait 10
set $0008EA CC,01
set $001773 32,00
call 81E9CD d=08DB db=80 p=30
set $0008EA CC,01
set $001773 3A,00
call 81E9CD d=08DB db=80 p=30
